    given-names: "Carlos Nicolás"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aisona-lab/peacethefrontier-research"
url: "https://peacethefrontier.com"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual research portfolio and reproducible simulation suite investigating autonomous agents
  as operational, institutional, and scientific infrastructure (2026–2036) across three falsifiable
  hypotheses: delegation economics and compound reliability (H1), multi-agent coordination and
  Goodhart benchmark distortion (H2), and verifiable-oracle scientific AI pipelines (H3).
